# FARO MFA: provision FARO_MFA_ENCRYPTION_KEY through protected operator secret storage.
# Required format: 32 random bytes encoded as 64 hex characters; no shared/default key.
# FARO_REQUIRE_PRIVILEGED_MFA=true enables production-equivalent staff MFA in development/test.
# In production privileged MFA is mandatory and cannot be disabled by this setting.
